<title>JAPAN: Airex to issue stocks in third-party allocation.</title>
<headline>Airex to issue stocks in third-party allocation.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airex Inc said on Monday that it had decided to issue 580,000 new shares in a third-party share allocation to Unitika Ltd.</p>
<p>The firm, a leading producer of specialised industrial printed circuit boards, said in a statement that the issuing price is 860 yen per share and the total issue amount is about 498.8 million yen. The payment date for the new shares is set for December 18.</p>
<p>The shares, registered on the over-the-counter market, stood at 830 yen in late Tokyo, down 30 yen.</p>
</text>
